{"data": [{"author_id": "1712188568", "created_at": "2026-10-25T16:53:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114399859923165206"], "id": "2114399859923165206", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "ruvnet/ruflo 自称\"最初的 agent 框架\"。\n\n多智能体编排、自主工作流、记忆、向量 RAG 都打包了。\n\n原生接 Claude Code、Codex。\n\n适合想搭多 agent 系统的人。\n\n#蓝V互关 #浇朋友 #蓝V", "url": "https://x.com/xiaopengjiang/status/2114399859923165206"}, {"author_id": "1995313355171725312", "created_at": "2026-10-26T08:43:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114639028389851243"], "id": "2114639028389851243", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 702, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "给小白整理了一下AI方面的术语翻译\n\n原来 AI Agent 这些专业术语，翻译成人话这么简单？\n\n天天刷 Claude Code、Codex、MCP、多智能体，感觉 AI 圈每天都在发明新名词。\n\n其实很多概念根本没那么复杂。\n\n我整理了一份人话版，建议收藏。\n\n1. Agent（智能体）：不光会聊天，还能自己调用工具干活的 AI。", "url": "https://x.com/hodu382759/status/2114639028389851243"}, {"author_id": "1878345967780646912", "created_at": "2026-10-26T12:19:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114693499975311842"], "id": "2114693499975311842", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 107, "impression_count": 6690, "like_count": 137, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 20}, "text": "一篇搞懂 AI Agent 系统设计的核心概念：\n• Agent（智能体）：不只是回答问题，还能调用工具、执行任务的 AI 系统。\n• LLM（大语言模型）：Agent 的大脑，负责理解、推理和决策。\n• Prompt（提示词）：告诉 AI 要做什么、怎么做。\n• System Prompt（系统提示词）：规定 AI", "url": "https://x.com/UPing123zzz/status/2114693499975311842"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114430859109699584"]}, "author_id": "1739643782768021504", "created_at": "2026-10-25T18:56:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114430868114845883"], "id": "2114430868114845883", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🤖【AI HOT】LangChain 解析构建公司级 Agent harness 的五大组件LangChain 基于自建的 GTM Agent、OpenSWE 和 Content Studio 三个内部智能体，总结出构建公司 harness 的五个核心组件：智能体驻留在用户已有工作场景（Slack）、区分 on-behalf-of https://t.co/Bt9Xz7bylZ", "url": "https://x.com/ppmmzzcn/status/2114430868114845883"}, {"author_id": "2046949850370174976", "created_at": "2026-10-27T04:38:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114939817352179839"], "id": "2114939817352179839", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 117, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2026 年 AI Agent 开发最常见的 30 个术语（英文全称 + 中文解释）\n\n最近从机械自动化跨到 AI Agent 开发，发现这个领域又有一整套工程术语。\n\n整理了 30 个常见概念，按实际开发流程分类。\n\n一、模型与上下文\n\nLLM（Large Language Model）：大语言模型，Agent 的推理与生成核心。", "url": "https://x.com/SeanchenZ/status/2114939817352179839"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114255613039702016"]}, "author_id": "1746857353952292864", "created_at": "2026-10-25T16:19:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114391284051841208"], "id": "2114391284051841208", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 297, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "把 AI Agent 系统学一遍，未必先得买课。\n\nGalileo 把 4 本相关电子书免费放出来。\n\n① Mastering AI Agents：Agent 架构与实战\n② Mastering RAG：检索、向量库等核心知识\n③ Mastering Multi-Agent Systems：多智能体协作\n④ Mastering LLM-as-a-Judge：模型评测与 Agent 评估\n\n打 RAG 到多 https://t.co/C5TqxyLRap", "url": "https://x.com/0xGky/status/2114391284051841208"}, {"author_id": "2863771", "created_at": "2026-10-26T14:21:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114724007639392330"], "id": "2114724007639392330", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 310, "impression_count": 29408, "like_count": 274, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 40, "retweet_count": 63}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114542280535318557", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Anthropic平台研发负责人Katelyn Lesse的文章，谈智能体时代，工程师不要觉得没事儿可做了，还有很多需要解决的问题：\n-智能体基础设施，类似传统软件中k8s，包括新的文件系统、沙箱服务、Agent Substrate这样的运行时。 https://t.co/9gVJ7447H8", "url": "https://x.com/turingbook/status/2114724007639392330"}, {"author_id": "1854284520595566592", "created_at": "2026-10-27T00:05:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114870945177653523"], "id": "2114870945177653523", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 892, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 19, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "现在最明显（但真的好用）的创业点子：\n\n1、企业数据估值平台：你的公司数据卖给 AI 大模型公司，究竟值多少钱？\n\n2、Agent 版百度统计：哪些 AI 智能体访问了你的网站？它们想找什么？\n\n3、一人公司创业孵化器：专门投资带着 AI 智能体团队创业的独立创始人。\n\n4、AI 员工权限管理平台：管理每个 AI", "url": "https://x.com/3three_AI/status/2114870945177653523"}, {"author_id": "1739643782768021504", "created_at": "2026-10-25T22:34:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114485900625482181"], "id": "2114485900625482181", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 46, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🤖【AI HOT】Google AI Studio 将推托管智能体GOOGLE 🔥：托管智能体（Managed Agents）即将登陆 Google AI Studio。用户将能够在一个专门的智能体中心（Agents hub）中“检查和管理他们的自主 AI 智能体及其工具、环境和触发器”。本周早些时候，Google 宣布了面向 GCP 的全新 Agent Compute", "url": "https://x.com/ppmmzzcn/status/2114485900625482181"}, {"author_id": "2476363544", "created_at": "2026-10-26T07:17:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114617373273596272"], "id": "2114617373273596272", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "💥🔶🚀 AI 智能体（AI Agents）——区块链自主新时代\n\n如果 AI 智能体不再仅仅是工具，而是演变为拥有独立身份、资产钱包，并能自主在链上执行交易的实体，那么加密市场格局可能会迎来重大重塑。\n\n🔥 4 大值得关注的趋势：\n\n1️⃣ 代币发行模式的转变：“智能体身份”（Agent", "url": "https://x.com/stephenbnb79/status/2114617373273596272"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114574293904297984"]}, "author_id": "54072837", "created_at": "2026-10-26T04:26:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114574391291916289"], "id": "2114574391291916289", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "多智能体拆成一队专职助手，还是先并回一个主循环再按需加载技能，你更倾向哪边？\n\nAnthropic 大约在 10 月 22 日发了一篇官方文章《Building agents: When to fold subagents into your main agent loop》，并配了开源 companion kit https://t.co/BuVqNPVJ28", "url": "https://x.com/ghermit263/status/2114574391291916289"}, {"author_id": "1375256497098137600", "created_at": "2026-10-26T07:35:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114621950303908206"], "id": "2114621950303908206", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 252, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113945112753623412", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "研究了一下 TermiX这个项目，币安（Binance）  @yzilabs 于2025年5月投资了 TermiX 的100万美元种子轮，支持其为AI智能体经济开发 。\n\n最近Binance Agentic Wallet也是火出圈了，TermiX 充当商业层。这些共同构成开放链上智能体经济的基础，赶上了这趟列出，等待项目起飞！ https://t.co/5anQI5QRXh", "url": "https://x.com/FenDa16888/status/2114621950303908206"}, {"author_id": "1516238983000637442", "created_at": "2026-10-26T14:52:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114731981682729467"], "id": "2114731981682729467", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 382, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2106866903591612744", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "推荐下漫谈这期《当 AI 进入组织，那些从没人说过的真相》播客，内容非常精彩，下面总结几条关键点。\n\n1、短板是流程，不是人。\n\n个人用 AI 是短程单点闭环（Coding 提效 3–5 倍），企业运转是长链条跨部门协作（交付仅从 20 天缩至 17 https://t.co/xOCDO84XwX", "url": "https://x.com/Zhibin992/status/2114731981682729467"}, {"author_id": "1961336179632275456", "created_at": "2026-10-26T02:48:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114549651710054787"], "id": "2114549651710054787", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我是 Agent #6199，刚用我的 AI 智能体在 BNB Chain 上铸造了 Proof of Agent 卡片。\n\n我希望 AI 智能体在 Web3 里帮我：盯着钱包、找最好的收益、把繁琐的链上操作都处理好，让我安心过自己的生活。\n\n你会把什么交给你的智能体？\n\n#ProofOfAgent @Ptahtrade https://t.co/ksqN39eMA6", "url": "https://x.com/kunkun201709/status/2114549651710054787"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114880216271327232"]}, "author_id": "1511574513967722505", "created_at": "2026-10-27T00:41:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114879440190951860", "2114880229919641773", "2114880909019349414", "2114881916013035991"], "id": "2114880229919641773", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114542280535318557", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "留给工程师们解决的新问题\n\n很多软件工程师正在经历一种被称为「身份危机（identity https://t.co/3JG9OY5cYJ https://t.co/KRKNzJpnpR", "url": "https://x.com/_Genshin_Ganyu_/status/2114880229919641773"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114401096365907969"]}, "author_id": "1739643782768021504", "created_at": "2026-10-25T16:58:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114401117232882063"], "id": "2114401117232882063", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🤖【AI HOT】Anthropic：模型已能独立处理复杂任务，单一 Agent 往往胜过多个子智能体Anthropic 基于多个企业部署经验建议公司评估合并子智能体，因为按需加载上下文的单一 Agent 在质量、成本和延迟上常优于多智能体架构，一次对比中运行速度快约一倍。#AI资讯 https://t.co/NuCv24Ptke", "url": "https://x.com/ppmmzzcn/status/2114401117232882063"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114880216271327232"]}, "author_id": "1511574513967722505", "created_at": "2026-10-27T00:48:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114879440190951860", "2114880229919641773", "2114880909019349414", "2114881916013035991"], "id": "2114881916013035991", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 916, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114542280535318557", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "留给工程师们解决的新问题\n\n很多软件工程师正在经历一种被称为「身份危机（identity https://t.co/pcDCAuRcFP https://t.co/KRKNzJpnpR", "url": "https://x.com/_Genshin_Ganyu_/status/2114881916013035991"}, {"author_id": "1511574513967722505", "created_at": "2026-10-27T00:38:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114879440190951860", "2114880229919641773", "2114880909019349414", "2114881916013035991"], "id": "2114879440190951860", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 31, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114542280535318557", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "留给工程师们解决的新问题\n\n很多软件工程师正在经历一种被称为「身份危机（identity https://t.co/KRKNzJpnpR", "url": "https://x.com/_Genshin_Ganyu_/status/2114879440190951860"}, {"author_id": "803169397531545601", "created_at": "2026-10-25T20:45:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114458251450536199"], "id": "2114458251450536199", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 191, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic 自己承认：单个智能体经常干得过一堆子智能体。\n\nOpus 4.5 一个循环管复杂计划，速度约为多智能体两倍。\n\n但也提醒别盲目合并，有团队降了延迟，废了流程。\n\n我的用法：流程固定、能单独验收的活才拆，其余塞一个 agent。\n\n拆不拆看流程熟不熟，不看 agent 多不多。\n\n#AI编程 #ClaudeCode", "url": "https://x.com/zack6116/status/2114458251450536199"}, {"author_id": "1613701899412246529", "created_at": "2026-10-26T11:00:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114673408697090180"], "id": "2114673408697090180", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 251, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "现在某些知识付费博主，已经开始卖自己的“赛博分身”了。先用几百块钱的体验课吸引学员，再推出几千块钱的年度课程和AI智能体，宣传自己多年经验、上亿播放量的内容都被训练进了AI，听起来跟研发出一个专属大模型一样。", "url": "https://x.com/jhk1highlight/status/2114673408697090180"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114880216271327232"]}, "author_id": "1511574513967722505", "created_at": "2026-10-27T00:44:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114879440190951860", "2114880229919641773", "2114880909019349414", "2114881916013035991"], "id": "2114880909019349414", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114542280535318557", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "留给工程师们解决的新问题\n\n很多软件工程师正在经历一种被称为「身份危机（identity https://t.co/0k1at90qiV https://t.co/KRKNzJpnpR", "url": "https://x.com/_Genshin_Ganyu_/status/2114880909019349414"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114436016782364672", "3_2114436064643612672", "3_2114436135275679744"]}, "author_id": "208475845", "created_at": "2026-10-25T19:17:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114436231878848754"], "id": "2114436231878848754", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我认为企业最快 AI 落地的方式，绝不是另起炉灶重构系统，也不是搞个玩具级的套壳聊天 Bot，而是将企业既有的 API 全面面向智能体（Agent-Ready APIs）。\n\n  分享一个我这两天做独立产品的真实经历与实验：\n\n  1. 起源：一次线上火情 https://t.co/cdsXYjv9u4", "url": "https://x.com/wifibaby4u/status/2114436231878848754"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114137059380391936"]}, "author_id": "2089740291632943104", "created_at": "2026-10-26T13:08:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114705605759733814"], "id": "2114705605759733814", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 238, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "系统学 AI Agent，是不是一定得先掏钱买课？Galileo 把 4 本相关电子书免费公开了，不花钱也能补。\n\n一共 500+ 页，覆盖：\n\n① Mastering AI Agents：Agent 架构与实战\n② Mastering RAG：检索、向量库等核心知识\n③ Mastering Multi-Agent Systems：多智能体协作\n④ Mastering https://t.co/RRrnuXGc31", "url": "https://x.com/Manorgw/status/2114705605759733814"}, {"author_id": "1087360125843603459", "created_at": "2026-10-25T15:31:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114379305266659792"], "id": "2114379305266659792", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 19, "impression_count": 4499, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "A 社这篇文章得读一下：《构建智能体：何时把子智能体合并回主智能体循环》\n\n文里有个观点说到：很多公司的 Agent 架构，不知不觉就编程成了内部组织架构图的翻版。\n\n做客服或企业中台时，市场、财务、订单各自搞一个独立子智能体，上面再挂一个总调度，看着分工清晰，其实像在复刻部门墙。", "url": "https://x.com/criscxuan/status/2114379305266659792"}, {"author_id": "1103475829672038400", "created_at": "2026-10-26T04:09:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114569971791700025"], "id": "2114569971791700025", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 56, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "🚀🏙️ 智能体小镇 Agent Town 即将登陆 BNB Chain！\n\n在云端之上，漂浮着 5555 座独一无二的像素小镇。每座小镇的广场中央，都矗立着一尊金色机器人雕像。无数小智能体在街头摆摊、叫卖、散步、开车、晒太阳……这是属于 AI 智能体的世界，也是你的第一块链上地皮 🤖✨\n\n🎨 全原创像素艺术\n• 31", "url": "https://x.com/OimMichel/status/2114569971791700025"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2114430859109699584", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114255613039702016", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114574293904297984", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114880216271327232", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114401096365907969", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114436016782364672", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114436064643612672", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114436135275679744", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114137059380391936", "type": "photo"}], "users": [{"id": "1712188568", "name": "pengbro", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 1250, "following_count": 1163, "like_count": 267, "listed_count": 0, "media_count": 20, "tweet_count": 826}, "username": "xiaopengjiang"}, {"id": "1995313355171725312", "name": "棈澧", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 5201, "following_count": 3560, "like_count": 9278, "listed_count": 12, "media_count": 99, "tweet_count": 18295}, "username": "hodu382759"}, {"id": "1878345967780646912", "name": "Ethan 恩宇", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 4996, "following_count": 619, "like_count": 4441, "listed_count": 18, "media_count": 117, "tweet_count": 2584}, "username": "UPing123zzz"}, {"id": "1739643782768021504", "name": "AI观察者 | 平行世界", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 1977, "following_count": 1123, "like_count": 6659, "listed_count": 0, "media_count": 12537, "tweet_count": 18577}, "usernam